    "description": "The Telecom SIM Portability API facilitates the seamless transfer of mobile service between different carriers. This API allows service providers to initiate and manage SIM portability requests, enabling end-users to switch networks while retaining their existing numbers. Typical consumers include telecom operators and service management platforms that require integration with business processes for handling portability applications. It promotes customer retention and satisfaction by simplifying the service transition for users.",
